'''Attack of the Li'ls''' (進撃のちびネコ, ''Shingeki no Chibi Neko'', '''Attack of the Li'l Cats''') is a 5-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (M): Cats' movement speed increases by 15%.

